  "claim_type": "observation",
  "body": "Prospective full-QPC timing, bounded automatic cyclic-GC deferral, native memory guards and protected source-read capture were implemented without recovery tuning. Collector timing directly accounted for two same-run evaluator pauses in probe002; earlier attribution remains inference. Probe003 remains invalid. Probe004 passed its fixed 900-second no-model diagnostic, but final native003 failed: all six protected reference recoveries completed and all resource gates passed, while stock1 had maximum lag 0.100149299981 seconds and 2/59 bad RTF windows. Its failed intervals include protected-journal fsync calls of 48.449 and 51.851 ms. Underlying OS/storage/scheduler cause remains unknown. This is apparatus evidence, not Robot-Codex performance or a causal comparison.",
